(14,'KEEP',[VII],'theory','External field bound of a specified critical-field ideal conductor','The statement explicitly permits magnetic penetration and sets the only material failure rule as internal B>B0. Maxwell current/field boundary and maximum-principle arguments constrain the outside field for that toy model; no microscopic Meissner/critical-current theory is required.'),
(15,'KEEP',[VI],'theory','Distributed capacitor with a fully supplied hysteretic switching resistor','All actual plate/ring/circuit and Z-voltage drawings were inspected. Radial Ohm conduction, capacitance/charge conservation and the two given switching thresholds define distributed RC evolution/relaxation cycles. No particle-detector microphysics is needed.'),
(16,'KEEP',[I,VI,VII],'theory','Classical electron pairs, opposite charges and planar many-particle motion','The source expressly says classical nonrelativistic electrodynamics and supplies uniform field/plane geometry. Newton Coulomb/Lorentz dynamics gives circles, relative periodicity, electron-positron encounters and qualitative collective motion; encounter is explicitly its annihilation criterion, not a QED rate calculation.'),
(17,'KEEP',[I,VII,VIII],'numerical','Magnetic braking of a falling resistive ring above a dipole','Ring resistance/radius, release height and aligned magnet geometry are given. Faraday flux/inductance circuit response and magnetic-force/gravity Newton dynamics yield motion/time with ring mass as a parameter; no quantum magnetism is requested.'),
(18,'KEEP',[X],'theory','Optical dispersion and gaps in a fully specified alternating plate stack','Indices/thicknesses and normal incidence are supplied. Standard Maxwell boundary-wave transfer matrices, periodic phase and quarter-wave expansion determine gap and long-wavelength behaviour. A brief quantum analogue comparison is peripheral, not a central unsupplied quantum spectrum calculation.'),
(19,'KEEP',[III,IV],'theory','Critiquing a chosen source-linked second-law paradox','All four model descriptions and discussion in the original linked article were read. The permitted choice includes a defined classical collision/gravity/heat-bath model; energy, momentum and entropy/equilibrium reasoning support or challenge its assumptions without requiring unsupplied specialist quantum physics. No perpetual-motion claim is endorsed.'),
(20,'KEEP',[III,IV],'theory','Mercury-sealed funnel geometry enforcing an equilibrium pV relation','Trapped ideal gas, fixed mercury volume and hydrostatic pressure set volume/plug-position equations. Geometric inverse design gives a funnel with pV constant along equilibrium positions; transient heating and stability caveats are ordinary thermodynamics.'),
(21,'REJECT',[],'theory','Constructing relativistic scalar gravity and judging its failure','Four-potential gradient is only a qualitative premise. Proper-time/mass/force transformation and relativistic orbit/variational laws are not operationally supplied and centrally determine every trajectory and Mercury comparison.'),
(22,'REJECT',[],'theory','Particle action in an unspecified relativistic tensor field','No relativistic action, tensor coupling, metric or geodesic prescription is supplied. Those outside SR/GR methods are the entire construction/variation/comparison task.'),
(23,'REJECT',[],'theory','Relativistic hypergravity under a partially supplied four-force','F_k=M^N*partial_k(Phi) is explicitly supplied. Four-momentum/proper-time/rest-mass and three-acceleration relation are not, so the formula is not a complete operational particle model for the requested energy/velocity/travel results.'),
(24,'REJECT',[],'theory','Separation of test masses in a named matter-dominated expanding spacetime','Named Robertson-Walker metric/parameters and initial real-space rest do not supply the actual metric, scale-factor law or test geodesic dynamics. Those central unsupplied cosmological relations determine separation after expansion.'),
(25,'REJECT',[],'theory','Full quantum spin-dipole rigid-rotor spectrum','Geometry and moment-spin proportionality are provided, but spin representation, operator Hamiltonian/eigenstates, exclusion and state-density rules are not. These central quantum prerequisites control every requested exact result.'),
(26,'REJECT',[],'theory','Magnetic quantum states confined by a hard half-space wall','Field/wall geometry and potential are stated, but quantum momentum representation, magnetic oscillator spectrum/eigen-equation and state/quantum-number rules are not. They are central to modified Landau levels and their interpretation.'),
(27,'REJECT',[],'mixed','Theory and experimental comparison for negative hydrogen-ion stability','No multi-electron quantum Hamiltonian, wave/variational bound-state prescription or electron statistics is supplied. Those specialized quantum methods centrally determine stability before any requested experimental comparison.'),
(28,'BORDERLINE',[IV],'theory','Whole low/high-temperature planar-rotor thermodynamics with an ambiguous classical/quantum prescription','Classical rotor kinetic energy plus the supplied h*cos(phi) field term supports thermal integration within foundations. The hatted interaction and requested low/high crossover can instead indicate quantum rotor levels/occupation, which are not supplied. The intended physical spectrum is not specified; preserve whole-task ambiguity.'),
(29,'REJECT',[],'theory','First-order quantum oscillator shifts for a supplied momentum perturbation','Perturbing operator form is given but quantum momentum/eigenstate representation and perturbation expectation rule are not. These central quantum methods determine both energy corrections.'),
(30,'REJECT',[],'theory','Time-dependent quantum oscillator Bogoliubov evolution and probabilities','Formal Hamiltonian/shift-operator ansatz and coefficient hints are supplied, but Heisenberg evolution, ladder action/commutators and state probability prescription are only named, not provided. Those central missing quantum rules precede the oscillator mathematics.'),
(31,'REJECT',[],'data_analysis','Gaussian variational quantum crystal with a supplied Morse potential and data','Product/Gaussian wavefunctions, pair potential and actual five-gas parameter table are supplied. Quantum kinetic expectation/Born normalization and variational state-energy interpretation are not operationally defined; these central missing quantum rules control zero-point width/stability and trends.'),
